<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia August unemployment rises to 13.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Slovenia August unemployment rises to 13.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p>			  Aug     July    Aug 95</p>
<p>    percentage	13.5    13.3     13.8</p>
<p>    total	   116,067  114,051  120,219</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
